{"id":"n17395-1-8","stage":4,"title":"애칭 · 爱称","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17395-1-8-1","ko":"애인을 부르는 애칭이 따로 있나요?","zh":"你有专门用来称呼恋人的昵称吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애인을","meaning":"爱人","explanation":"애인：爱人；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"애인","audio":"/audio/97aae2f9eae59ad11035.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73134","senseId":"1","lemma":"애인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애인을","audio":"/audio/171bc3a3570721d7dd5c.mp3"}},{"text":"부르는","meaning":"叫做，称为","explanation":"부르다：叫做，称为；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"부르다","audio":"/audio/169eb5d7a0d76e97fa7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57304","senseId":"10","lemma":"부르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부르는","audio":"/audio/2d37c4d9f3d6714f3381.mp3"}},{"text":"애칭이","meaning":"爱称，昵称","explanation":"애칭：爱称，昵称；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"애칭","audio":"/audio/bc2830a3fc91260a4c64.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17395","senseId":"1","lemma":"애칭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애칭이","audio":"/audio/1f04b90c228d69ea2685.mp3"}},{"text":"따로","meaning":"分开，单独","explanation":"따로：分开，单独","readings":[{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49672","senseId":"1","lemma":"따로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따로","audio":"/audio/6d325aa9f77b0fc574c1.mp3"}},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있나요","audio":"/audio/0eb260e471116d837abb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"97aae2f9eae59ad1","term":"애인","zh":"爱人","audio":"/audio/97aae2f9eae59ad11035.mp3","entryId":"73134","definition":"男女之间相爱的人。","pronunciation":["애ː인"]},{"id":"169eb5d7a0d76e97","term":"부르다","zh":"叫做，称为","au